"A bigger code cache empties less often and takes more memory (about 1.75 times its size); Henge picks one by its memory limit: 1.5 GB where there is plenty, 512 MB where there is little. Applies the next time Henge opens. If JIT stops turning on, or a Mac closes Henge during setup, choose a smaller one." = "更大的代码缓存清空频率更低，但占用更多内存（约为其大小的 1.75 倍）；Henge 会根据内存限额选择：充足时为 1.5 GB，紧张时为 512 MB。下次打开 Henge 时生效。如果 JIT 无法开启，或 Mac 在设置过程中关闭了 Henge，请选择更小的数值。";
"macOS draws a frame for every refresh: 30 Hz leaves the most of the emulated CPU to apps, at the cost of choppier animation; 60 Hz is smoother. Faster disk writes order them without waiting for a full sync; a sudden power loss could lose the last ones. Quicker wake keeps an idle CPU watching for work for 50 µs, at some battery cost. Superblocks let translated code run past conditional branches. Changes apply the next time a Mac starts." = "macOS 每次刷新都会绘制一帧：30 Hz 能把最多的模拟 CPU 资源留给应用，代价是动画不够流畅；60 Hz 更顺滑。快速磁盘写入无需等待完整同步即可排序；突然断电可能丢失最后几次写入。更快唤醒会让空闲 CPU 保持 50 微秒侦测任务，会增加耗电。超级块让已翻译代码可以越过条件分支。更改在下一次启动 Mac 时生效。";
"When you leave Henge, the running Mac is saved to storage, and opening it again picks up where it was in a few seconds, even after iOS closes Henge. The save is about the size of the Mac's memory in use, compressed. The Mac pauses while Henge is in the background, so its sound stops. Experimental." = "离开 Henge 时，运行中的 Mac 会保存到存储器，即使 iOS 关闭了 Henge，再次打开也能在几秒内从原处继续。存档大小约等于 Mac 已用内存压缩后的体积。Henge 在后台时 Mac 会暂停，因此声音会停止。实验性功能。";
"Bring in a .dmg or an .app (the + button on Home) and run it inside Henge through its own translation layer, without starting a Mac. Programs without windows run today; apps with windows don't yet. Experimental." = "通过首页的 + 按钮导入 .dmg 或 .app，无需启动 Mac 即可在 Henge 的转换层中运行。目前支持无窗口程序，暂不支持有窗口的应用。实验性功能。";
"System follows the %@'s Light or Dark setting. Henge stays dark while a Mac is running." = "跟随 %@ 的浅色或深色设置。Mac 运行时 Henge 保持深色。";
"Share henge.log" = "分享 henge.log";

