/* ===== MacApps 判定文案 ===== */
"Runs without macOS (experimental)" = "无需 macOS 即可运行（实验性）";
"A program without windows: Henge loads it into itself and runs it, with no Mac started." = "无窗口程序：Henge 将其载入自身运行，无需启动 Mac。";
"Not yet: a SwiftUI app" = "暂不支持：SwiftUI 应用";
"iOS has the SwiftUI it calls, but starting it as an app inside Henge isn't done yet. It runs in a Mac." = "iOS 具备它所需的 SwiftUI，但尚未支持在 Henge 中作为应用启动。它可在 Mac 中运行。";
"Not yet: a Mac Catalyst app" = "暂不支持：Mac Catalyst 应用";
"It's built from an iPad app's code, so most of what it calls exists on iOS, but starting it inside Henge isn't done yet. It runs in a Mac." = "它由 iPad 应用的代码构建，因此它调用的大部分内容在 iOS 上都存在，但尚未支持在 Henge 中启动。它可在 Mac 中运行。";
"Experimental: an AppKit app" = "实验性：AppKit 应用";
"It draws its windows with AppKit, which iOS doesn't have; Henge stands in its own. Made for browsers built on Chromium (Chromium, apps built with Electron or CEF); others may stop early." = "它用 AppKit 绘制窗口，而 iOS 没有 AppKit；Henge 提供了自己的替代实现。专为基于 Chromium 的浏览器打造（Chromium、用 Electron 或 CEF 构建的应用）；其他应用可能提前退出。";
"Intel only" = "仅限 Intel";
"It has no Apple silicon code. A Mac with Rosetta runs it; Henge can't yet." = "它不含 Apple 芯片代码。带 Rosetta 的 Mac 可以运行它；Henge 暂不支持。";

