/* ===== JITNetworkAdvice ===== */
"This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Henge's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected." = "此设备关闭了连接，通常表示它不再接受 Henge 的配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。";
"Henge couldn't reach this device. Connect LocalDevVPN, then try again." = "Henge 无法访问此设备。请连接 LocalDevVPN 后重试。";
"LocalDevVPN can show Connected while iOS still sends Henge's connection over cellular. Turn Cellular Data off in Control Center, wait 2 seconds, then turn it back on. Or join any Wi-Fi once; a hotspot works. Keep LocalDevVPN connected, turn off other VPNs such as Tailscale, then try again." = "LocalDevVPN 可能显示已连接，但 iOS 仍通过蜂窝网络发送 Henge 的连接。请在控制中心关闭蜂窝数据，等待 2 秒后再打开。或者连接任意 Wi-Fi 一次，热点也可以。保持 LocalDevVPN 连接，关闭 Tailscale 等其他 VPN，然后重试。";

